Name: netlink-packet-route
URL: https://github.com/rust-netlink/netlink-packet-route
Revision: 570c4f2d8fabdd103666db9e02e1db3d04fd04fb
Version: 0.20.1
Security Critical: yes

License File: LICENSE-MIT
  License: MIT

Description:
  This crate provides serialization/deserialization of NETLINK ROUTE messages.
  It is used by Starnix to serve the NETLINK protocol.

  This crate forks upstream version 0.20.1. There are several divergences from
  upstream (See the git history for the complete list). At this point, there is
  no intention of re-merging with upstream.
